#: about1.mw:1
msgid "What is WikiToLearn?"
msgstr "¿Qué ye WikiToLearn?"

#: about1.mw:2
msgid ""
"WikiToLearn was founded in September 2015, when a group of students from the "
"University of Milano Bicocca had the necessity to share their notes to study "
"for their exams."
msgstr ""
"WikiToLearn fundóse en setiembre de 2015 cuando un grupu d'estudiantes de la "
"universidá de Milano Bicocca tuvieron la necesidá de compartir les sos notes "
"pa estudiar pa los esámenes."

#: about1.mw:4
msgid ""
"Legally represented by KDE e.V., and part of KDE, WikiToLearn was born as a "
"non-profit community and an open source project, which wants to provide free "
"and collaborative textbooks with the help of the world of University and "
"Academia."
msgstr ""
"Representada llegalmente por KDE e.V. y parte de KDE, WikiToLearn ñació como "
"una comunidá de códigu abiertu y ensin ánimu de llucru que quier fornir "
"llibros gratuitos y collaborativos per duana del mundu de la universidá y "
"les academies."

#: about1.mw:4
msgid "Who are the WikiToLearn-ers?"
msgstr "¿Quién son los WikiToLean-eros?"

#: about1.mw:7
msgid ""
"The WikiToLearn community is made of students, researchers, professors and "
"anyone who intends to support free knowledge worldwide. Students can start "
"writing their notes in a collaborative way, integrating and reviewing them "
"to achieve the best possible quality. Academics receive feedback by the "
"possibility to check the correctness and the completeness of the notes taken "
"by their students during lectures."
msgstr ""
"La comunidá de WikiToLearn ta fecha d'estudiantes, investigadores, "
"profesores y cualesquiera que tenga la intención de sofitar la conocencia "
"llibre pel mundu. Los estudiantes puen comenzar por escribir les sos notes "
"d'un mou collaborativu, integrando y revisandoles pa consiguir la meyor "
"calidá posible. Los académicos reciben comentarios cola posibilidá de "
"comprobar la correición y completáu de les notes tomaes polos estudiantes "
"demientres les clases."
